id: pm-web-tg1s
title: Consume the canonical attestation gate instead of carrying a copy of it
description: "This repository carried its own 672-line shell scanner and 467-line verifier, duplicated from the same origin as every other package in the fleet. That gate decides whether an artefact may reach the registry, so a false pass is the failure that matters. The canonical implementation (pm-ops/attestation and pm-ops/shell-scan) has had fifteen fail-open constructions closed in it; the vendored copy is frozen and still admits constructions closed after that. BEFORE check.sh: nonliteral-overwrite,nonliteral-overwrite-cmdsub,bare-brace-scope-escape,subshell-scope-escape,cmdsub-in-command-position,backtick-command-position,unset-after-bind,if-branch-bind,semicolon-same-line-bind (9 wrong). AFTER target: nonliteral-overwrite,nonliteral-overwrite-cmdsub only."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[2]: attestation,security
created_at: "2026-09-07T09:51:32.698Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-07T10:02:01.953Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-07T10:02:01.912Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-07T10:02:01.912Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: Delete scripts/shell-command-scan.ts; Rewrite scripts/verify-release-publish-attestation.ts as thin launcher over pm-ops/attestation; Repoint verify-release-changelog-date.ts at pm-ops/shell-scan; Replace test suite to assert consumption not re-test shell model
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T09:57:13.397Z",pi-agent,"AFTER check.sh: nonliteral-overwrite,nonliteral-overwrite-cmdsub,quoted-metachar-value,single-quoted-metachar-value. Corpus expanded from 30 to 33 cases since the task was written. The 2 extra wrong cases are new corpus entries open in canonical pm-ops@2026.9.7 itself, same as the known-open nonliteral-overwrite and nonliteral-overwrite-cmdsub. Verified verify === directVerify from pm-ops/attestation by reference equality. BEFORE had 9 wrong; AFTER has 4 wrong, all 4 open in canonical."
close_reason: "Convergence complete. Deleted scripts/shell-command-scan.ts (672 lines), rewrote verify-release-publish-attestation.ts as thin launcher over pm-ops/attestation (467 to 57 lines), repointed verify-release-changelog-date.ts at pm-ops/shell-scan, replaced test suite to assert consumption. BEFORE: 9 wrong. AFTER: 4 wrong (all 4 open in canonical pm-ops@2026.9.7). All gates pass: check, docstring, coverage, verify:release-publish-attestation, test (387 pass)."
body: ""
